      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:leviticus/7/37">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:leviticus/7/37/1"/>And it is said,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:leviticus/7/37/2"/>This is the law
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:leviticus/7/37/3"/>of the burnt-offering,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:leviticus/7/37/4"/>the meal-offering,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:leviticus/7/37/5"/>the sin-offering,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:leviticus/7/37/6"/>the guilt-offering,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:leviticus/7/37/7"/>the inauguration-offerings
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:leviticus/7/37/8"/>and the peace-offerings.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
